        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maleic anhydride from the direct oxidation of n-butane, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maleic anhydride from the direct oxidation of n-butane, at plant
Multi-output process, is one of two processes that produce both maleic anhydride and steam. The values presented in this report nay be considered BAT  (best available technology) and reflect current practices in Europe.;
UUID: eb2de9bf-0353-315f-8fad-245f997d2549
all precursors, transports and infrastructure are included
Location: RER
Technology: represents a current cross-section of actual plants in Europe
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: see technology 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_eb2de9bf-0353-315f-8fad-245f997d2549.xml</text>
